  - The three served asset directories listed above must remain present with
    their shipped files; the callers read the files sitting in those
    directories directly from disk and exercise the routes against them.

## Test harness boundary
  The calling side is a Python pytest process running in the same container
  that drives everything through the `requests` library over HTTP. It locates
  the installed package by trying the user directory'"'"'s `node_modules` first,
  then the global npm prefixes, then a filesystem-wide search, in order to
