- **Outputs and errors:** Sets `Content-Type: application/json`. Body: `models.MeshSyncResourcesAPIResponse` as JSON — `page` (effective page), `page_size` (row count when `pagesize=all`, otherwise the numeric limit), `total_count` (matches before pagination), `resources` (empty array when none match). Defaults: page ≤0/unparseable → 1; pagesize ≤0/unparseable/absent → 25 (`defaultPageSize`); `all` → no limit. On `clusterIds` decode, fetch, or encode failure: log `ErrFetchMeshSyncResources(err)` and respond 500 with its `.Error()` text plus trailing newline.
