- **Required sequencing and state:** Filters (`kind`, `apiVersion`) and search precede the count; count precedes pagination and ordering; limit/offset apply only when non-zero; an `order` value the handler accepts orders results on it — descending when `sort` is `desc`, ascending otherwise; empty `order` → no ordering.
