- **Region boundary:** `Self-contained` — the range spans the entire method declaration; the retained text above completes the preceding top-level declaration and nothing follows the region. The retained `registerSocketEndpoint` references `s.socketHandler(handle, options)`, so the method name, receiver, parameter count/order, and return type must be preserved exactly.
