- **Observable behavior:** Builds a Picture Loss Indication RTCP-FB packet into `buf`. The feedback common header is seeded from the session'"'"'s cached RTCP common-header template (sender SSRC), then `pt` is set to `RTCP_PSFB` (206), `count` to 1 (FMT=1), and `length` to the network-byte-order value of `len/4 - 1` (i.e. 2). PLI carries no FCI.
